{
  "id": "zoo-visit",
  "title": "和家人逛動物園",
  "titleEn": "Visiting the Zoo with Family",
  "category": "休閒生活",
  "level": "入門",
  "image": {
    "src": "/images/scenes/zoo-visit.webp",
    "alt": "在陽光明媚的週末，一家四口走在綠意盎然的動物園步道上，孩子們興奮地指著圍欄裡吃樹葉的高大長頸鹿與龐大的大象，媽媽拿著相機面帶微笑準備為大家拍照。",
    "width": 1536,
    "height": 1024
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "On Sunday, my family walks happily into the "
        },
        {
          "text": "zoo",
          "wordIds": [
            "zoo"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "星期天，我和家人開心地走進動物園。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "We are excited to visit every friendly "
        },
        {
          "text": "animal",
          "wordIds": [
            "animal"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "我們很興奮能拜訪每一隻友善的動物。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "We watch giraffes eat green leaves, and I say, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "the-giraffe-is-so-tall"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "giraffe",
          "phraseIds": [
            "the-giraffe-is-so-tall"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "giraffe"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " is so ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "the-giraffe-is-so-tall"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tall",
          "phraseIds": [
            "the-giraffe-is-so-tall"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "tall"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "the-giraffe-is-so-tall"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "我們看著長頸鹿吃綠葉，我說：「長頸鹿好高喔。」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Then my little brother points and shouts, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Look at the ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "look-at-the-elephant"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "elephant",
          "phraseIds": [
            "look-at-the-elephant"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "elephant"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "!",
          "phraseIds": [
            "look-at-the-elephant"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "接著我弟弟指著並喊道：「看那隻大象！」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Mom holds up her camera and asks, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Can we take a ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "can-we-take-a-picture"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "picture",
          "phraseIds": [
            "can-we-take-a-picture"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "picture"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "can-we-take-a-picture"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "媽媽舉起相機問：「我們可以拍張照嗎？」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "We all smile together for the camera, and I say, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "I love the ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "i-love-the-zoo"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "zoo",
          "phraseIds": [
            "i-love-the-zoo"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "zoo"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "!",
          "phraseIds": [
            "i-love-the-zoo"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "我們大家一起對著鏡頭微笑，我說：「我好喜歡動物園！」"
    }
  ],
